// A confirmed automatic ReturningSameB restore must not publish another copy
// of the local Rune balance. Only the c3f230/c3f460 loading settlements are
// suppressed; the 5c38f0 death command must remain native even if PGD delivery
// is delayed. The nonzero branch skips publication but keeps the 66e8b0 tail.
// Host authorization, not receipt of a complete restore blob, starts protection.
// Do not clear an existing bloodstain: it may predate the disconnection.
